        <link:link rdf:resource="#item_200"/>
        <dc:title>Characterization of the pleiotropic phenotypes of rifampin-resistant rpoB mutants of Escherichia coli</dc:title>
        <dcterms:abstract>We used our collection of 17 sequenced rifampin resistance alleles in rpoB to perform a systematic analysis of the phenotypes historically reported with this class of mutants, including growth phenotype, ability to support the growth of different bacteriophages, ability to maintain the F' episome, interaction with mutant alleles at other loci, sensitivity to uracil, inhibition by 5-fluorouridine, and dominance. We found that mutational changes leading to the same phenotype were often located together and that certain phenotypes were associated with one another.</dcterms:abstract>
        <dc:date>09/1989</dc:date>
        <z:language>en</z:language>
        <z:libraryCatalog>DOI.org (Crossref)</z:libraryCatalog>
        <dc:identifier>
            <dcterms:URI>
                <rdf:value>https://journals.asm.org/doi/10.1128/jb.171.9.5229-5231.1989</rdf:value>
            </dcterms:URI>
        </dc:identifier>
        <dcterms:dateSubmitted>2026-01-20 06:52:46</dcterms:dateSubmitted>
        <bib:pages>5229-5231</bib:pages>
    </bib:Article>
    <bib:Memo rdf:about="#item_199">
        <rdf:value>&lt;div data-citation-items=&quot;%5B%7B%22uris%22%3A%5B%22http%3A%2F%2Fzotero.org%2Fusers%2F19606070%2Fitems%2F6ZUUFXMW%22%5D%2C%22itemData%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22http%3A%2F%2Fzotero.org%2Fusers%2F19606070%2Fitems%2F6ZUUFXMW%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22article-journal%22%2C%22abstract%22%3A%22We%20used%20our%20collection%20of%2017%20sequenced%20rifampin%20resistance%20alleles%20in%20rpoB%20to%20perform%20a%20systematic%20analysis%20of%20the%20phenotypes%20historically%20reported%20with%20this%20class%20of%20mutants%2C%20including%20growth%20phenotype%2C%20ability%20to%20support%20the%20growth%20of%20different%20bacteriophages%2C%20ability%20to%20maintain%20the%20F'%20episome%2C%20interaction%20with%20mutant%20alleles%20at%20other%20loci%2C%20sensitivity%20to%20uracil%2C%20inhibition%20by%205-fluorouridine%2C%20and%20dominance.%20We%20found%20that%20mutational%20changes%20leading%20to%20the%20same%20phenotype%20were%20often%20located%20together%20and%20that%20certain%20phenotypes%20were%20associated%20with%20one%20another.%22%2C%22container-title%22%3A%22Journal%20of%20Bacteriology%22%2C%22DOI%22%3A%2210.1128%2Fjb.171.9.5229-5231.1989%22%2C%22ISSN%22%3A%220021-9193%2C%201098-5530%22%2C%22issue%22%3A%229%22%2C%22journalAbbreviation%22%3A%22J%20Bacteriol%22%2C%22language%22%3A%22en%22%2C%22page%22%3A%225229-5231%22%2C%22source%22%3A%22DOI.org%20(Crossref)%22%2C%22title%22%3A%22Characterization%20of%20the%20pleiotropic%20phenotypes%20of%20rifampin-resistant%20rpoB%20mutants%20of%20Escherichia%20coli%22%2C%22URL%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fjournals.asm.org%2Fdoi%2F10.1128%2Fjb.171.9.5229-5231.1989%22%2C%22volume%22%3A%22171%22%2C%22author%22%3A%5B%7B%22family%22%3A%22Jin%22%2C%22given%22%3A%22D%20J%22%7D%2C%7B%22family%22%3A%22Gross%22%2C%22given%22%3A%22C%20A%22%7D%5D%2C%22accessed%22%3A%7B%22date-parts%22%3A%5B%5B%222026%22%2C1%2C20%5D%5D%7D%2C%22issued%22%3A%7B%22date-parts%22%3A%5B%5B%221989%22%2C9%5D%5D%7D%7D%7D%5D&quot; data-schema-version=&quot;9&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;“Five of the six mutants nonpermissive at low temperatures were clustered and affected amino acids 531, 532, 533, 563, and 564. Interestingly, the group of Rif' mutants that prevented growth at high temperature (those affecting amino acids 522 to 529) were located immediately 5' to this group. Possibly, the changes in this region of the protein have large effects on the structure of the enzyme which are manifested as improper folding or functioning at the temperature extremes. Alternatively, clustering of mutations may indicate that this region is directly involved in growth at high temperature, perhaps by interaction with an alternate sigma factor or another factor(s)” &lt;span class=&quot;citation&quot; data-citation=&quot;%7B%22citationItems%22%3A%5B%7B%22uris%22%3A%5B%22http%3A%2F%2Fzotero.org%2Fusers%2F19606070%2Fitems%2F6ZUUFXMW%22%5D%2C%22locator%22%3A%221%22%7D%5D%2C%22properties%22%3A%7B%7D%7D&quot;&gt;(&lt;span class=&quot;citation-item&quot;&gt;Jin and Gross, 1989, p. 1&lt;/span&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;</rdf:value>
    </bib:Memo>
